          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"part-c-heating-and-cooling-of-invar-core\">Part C: Heating and Cooling of Invar Core</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Repeat the same analysis steps for the Invar (ferromagnet) sample:</span></span>"
